🔥 Variance + PCA (Your Idea Summary)
✅ Step 1: Variance Filtering
Compute variance for each pixel (feature)
If variance ≈ 0 → drop it
Why?
Pixel is almost constant across all images
Carries no useful information
Only adds noise + computation

👉 Result: remove dead features

✅ Step 2: PCA (Principal Component Analysis)
Take remaining features
Transform them into new features (principal components)
Each component = combination of multiple pixels
Keep only top k components (highest variance)

👉 Result: compress useful information
